    "title": "Persona 5 Joker 4K -Customizable [Day/Night Cycle]",
    "description": "Persona 5 Joker 4K - Time Cycle [Customizable]\n\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/lja52Fs.gif[/img]\n\n-4k (3840X2160)\n-Time Cycle ( Morning/Afternoon/Night - Sun/Night logo - Night Background color or not)\n-Parallax effect\n-Audio Responsive\n-38 OST Persona 5 & Royal ! (instrumental).\n___________________________________\n\nThis wallpaper is customizable!\nYou can choose :\n-Deactivate title logo\n-Change color of running Joker\n-Deactivate or change \"Abstract Line\" color\n-Deactivate \"Take Your Hearts\" logo\n-Deactivate \"Floating letters\" effect\n-Add rain effect\n-Add \"Blue Fire\" effect\n-Deactivate shaking camera\n-Remove train\n-Remove 2 audio designs (music note and vinyl)\n\nIf you don't like the color change (night), you can remove it. To do this, check all the boxes in the \"Time Cycle Deactivate Blue Color\" option, and the Time Cycle will still be on, but the color will remain red !\n\nTime Cycle :\n06:00 am-12:00 pm / Morning-Sun logo - red Background\n12:00 am-19:00 pm / Afternoon-Sun logo - red Background\n19:00 pm-06:00 am / Night-Sun logo - blue Background\n\nUpdate :\n14/01/2026 : Add 12 Hour Clock / Military Time\n\nTip :\nYou can assign a keyboard shortcut to the wallpaper (right-click) like ctrl+p for example. This can be useful if one of the OSTs repeats itself or you want to change it.\n\n\n____________________________________\n\n[h1]DISCLAIMER[/h1]\nI do not own any artwork , I only do the animations. If the source is missing and you know who it is, please write a comment with the artist's name\n\n______________________________\n\n[url=https://ko-fi.com/themanofsteel] [img]https://i.imgur.com/RtOPVLd.png[/img] [/url]\n\n[url=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=YPPCFP99K9R6E] [img]https://i.imgur.com/tVgae8D.png[/img] [/url]",
